## Estructura de Datos

### Prospectos (GeoJSON)
```javascript
{
  type: "FeatureCollection",
  features: [{
    type: "Feature",
    geometry: { type: "Point", coordinates: [lon, lat] },
    properties: {
      nombre: "Carnicería López",
      categoria_fcarnes: "RETAIL",     // MAYOREO | RETAIL | PROCESO
      tier: "A_PREMIUM",                // A_PREMIUM | B_ALTA | C_MEDIA | D_BAJA
      score_total: 85.5,
      macro_region: "NORESTE",
      zona_logistica: "LOCAL",          // LOCAL | REGIONAL | FORANEA | LEJANA
      distancia_planta_km: 45,
      telefono: "8112345678",
      url_streetview: "https://...",
      ai_analizado: true,
      ai_scene_vitality: 8.5,
      ai_target_visibility: 7.2
    }
  }]
}
```

### TAM por Región (CSV)
```csv
macro_region,tam_bruto,tam_neto,clientes_fcarnes,penetracion_pct,distancia_sakbe_km,costo_logistico_mxn
NORESTE,15000,12000,3000,20.0,0,0
CENTRO,25000,24900,100,0.4,980,8500
...
```

